    "updated_at": "2016-05-20T12:50:37Z",
    "body": "@zcorpan I need to rewrite the src of all tracks that are going to be used (and only the ones that are going to be used, since I will also be requesting them through some webrtc p2p infrastructure and don't want to request things that aren't being used) with blob URLs, as I have a scenario where all URLs on a page are going to be invalid until rewritten by JavaScript (out of control of the server).\n\nAlso, I noticed that TextTrack doesn't have an `src` property, so I haven't really solved my issue unfortunately. The closest solution I have is to _hope_ the user specified labels on the tracks, from which I can build CSS selector queries to get the relevant <track> elements for rewriting.\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
