    "updated_at": "2016-05-20T12:58:04Z",
    "body": "Not all `TextTrack`s _have_ a source URL; some are inband with the video resource itself, and some might be created by the `video.addTextTrack()` method. However, those that were sourced from a `<track>` element can be accessed via `textTrack.track`, and that has a `src` attribute.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
