    "body": "@zcorpan Sorry for the edits.\n\nAlso, I realized that a solution is to do `Array.from(mediaElement.querySelectorAll(\"track\")).filter(track=>track.src&&track.track.mode===\"hidden\"||track.track.mode===\"showing\")`. This whole time I was looking in the wrong place for the src.\n\nI only care about TextTracks with an src, so my issue has been resolved with your suggestion.\n",
