    "updated_at": "2016-05-20T13:31:09Z",
    "body": "Don't worry about it :-)\n\nYes, but it could still make sense to add stuff here.\n\n> There should be a `TextTrack.src` getter and setter for getting and changing TextTrack URLs.\n\nI don't think this is great as it's confusing what should happen for non-`<track>` tracks. Also the attributes that do exist (kind/label/language) on `TextTrack` are readonly.\n\n> Alternatively, there could be some attribute that lets me get a reference to a `TextTrack`'s corresponding `<track>` element.\n\nThis makes perfect sense to me.\n\nI also think it makes sense to have a convenience API to get the enabled `TextTrack`s for a media element, like you suggested earlier, with something like `mediaElement.enabledTextTracks`.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
