    "created_at": "2016-06-01T09:23:22Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-06-01T09:23:22Z",
    "body": "Implementation-side, I was kind of hoping that a `TextTrack` object could be unaware of who created it, even if that isn't the case currently. As the code currently looks, it would be trivial to implement a `TextTrack.prototype.track` that returns the `HTMLTrackElement` or null if there is none. It would be a bit silly that one can write `track.track.track.track` and so on, not sure if that's likely to add to confusion or not.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
