    "created_at": "2016-06-01T11:38:27Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-06-01T11:38:27Z",
    "body": "Oh look, I had forgotten about this:\nhttps://w3c.github.io/media-source/#audio-track-extensions\n\nSo it looks like we already have some precedent for this kind of thing, and that it's too late for a union of sources. I suppose that one could imagine having both a `mediaElement` and a `sourceBuffer` at the same time, if that's any consolation.\n",
